Subject: [PATCH 023/110] fix(dog): close accumulated plugin mails in gt dog
 done (hq-lsoei) (#3541)

Plugin dispatch mails to dogs were never closed, causing inbox to accumulate
100-238+ open Plugin: X beads. ListUnread() returned all open beads, so every
UserPromptSubmit hook re-injected the full backlog, ballooning context to 60-70%
and freezing the deacon via compaction/hook conflicts.

gt dog done now archives all open Plugin: mails from the dog inbox before
clearing work and terminating the session.

Co-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
